<view class="publish-page"><view class="publish-head"><view class="publish-kicker">WRITE THE JOURNEY</view><view class="publish-title">把这次出发留给大家</view><view class="publish-hint">真实的路线、照片和感受，会成为下一位旅行者的参考。</view></view><view class="publish-form"><view class="field"><text>标题</text><input maxlength="30" placeholder="给这篇笔记一个标题" value="{{title}}" bindinput="inputTitle"/></view><view class="field"><text>正文</text><textarea maxlength="500" placeholder="说说这趟旅程吧…" value="{{content}}" bindinput="inputContent" auto-height="true"/></view><view class="field"><text>图片 {{images.length}}/9</text><view class="image-grid"><view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="*this" class="upload-image"><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="remove-image" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeImage">×</view></view><view wx:if="{{images.length < 9}}" class="add-image" bindtap="chooseImages">＋<text>添加图片</text></view></view></view><view class="field"><text>话题</text><scroll-view class="topic-scroll" scroll-x show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view wx:for="{{topics}}" wx:key="topicId" class="topic-chip {{topicId === item.topicId ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.topicId}}" data-name="{{item.name}}" bindtap="chooseTopic">#{{item.name}}</view></scroll-view></view><view class="field"><text>地点（可选）</text><input maxlength="100" placeholder="例如：吉安·渼陂古村" value="{{locationName}}" bindinput="inputLocation"/></view><view class="publish-note">提交后默认进入内容审核，审核通过后会公开展示。</view><button class="submit-button" bindtap="submit" loading="{{sending}}">{{sending ? '正在提交' : '提交笔记'}}</button><view wx:if="{{uploadProgress}}" class="upload-progress">{{uploadProgress}}</view></view></view>
